  "source": "; hello.zasm - prints a string, one byte at a time\nstart:\n    ldi  r1, msg        ; r1 = pointer to the string\nloop:\n    ldb  r0, [r1]       ; r0 = *r1\n    cmpi r0, 0          ; end of string?\n    jz   done\n    out  r0             ; print the character\n    addi r1, 1\n    jmp  loop\ndone:\n    halt\n\nmsg:\n    .string \"Hello, ZERO!\\n\"\n",
